translate portuguese episode024_a744ce6e:

    # "Hannah ushered us into a waiting room and left us after bringing some refreshments."
    "Hannah nos levou a uma sala de espera, e nos deixou após trazer umas bebidas."

# game/episode024.rpy:103
translate portuguese episode024_bb604716:

    # "The wait began."
    "Começou a espera."

# game/episode024.rpy:105
translate portuguese episode024_9a3c5bdf:

    # av "How do you rate our chances with the Tubloshi?"
    av "O que acha das nossas chances com os Tubloshi?"

# game/episode024.rpy:107
translate portuguese episode024_805e2657:

    # c "I think we stand a good chance of gaining their support."
    c "Acho que vamos ter uma boa chance de conseguir o apoio deles."

# game/episode024.rpy:109
translate portuguese episode024_f0f69dd4:

    # zi "Agreed."
    zi "Concordo."

# game/episode024.rpy:110
translate portuguese episode024_0f04ed34:

    # zi "They seem to have not forgotten what we did for them previously, so that works in our favor."
    zi "Parece que não esqueceram do que fizemos por eles, então temos isso a nosso favor."

# game/episode024.rpy:112
translate portuguese episode024_3f42f57a:

    # c "I’m not sure, it could go either way."
    c "Não sei muito bem. Pode ser que sim, ou não."

# game/episode024.rpy:114
translate portuguese episode024_3106effe:

    # zi "Yes, they were very held back in their response."
    zi "É, a resposta dele foi bem contida."

# game/episode024.rpy:116
translate portuguese episode024_af7bf4a7:

    # c "Yes, that was my impression as well."
    c "Sim, também tive essa impressão."

# game/episode024.rpy:117
translate portuguese episode024_a177a947:

    # c "At any rate, now all we can do is wait."
    c "Enfim, agora só podemos esperar."

# game/episode024.rpy:132
translate portuguese episode024_8e711d98:

    # "Just when I was about to go to sleep, my tablet received a message."
    "Logo quando estava para cair no sono, chegou uma mensagem no meu tablet."

# game/episode024.rpy:133
translate portuguese episode024_e8b0fa7d:

    # "It was Thyia, telling me to stay awake for just a little while longer, because she was on her way to me."
    "Era a Thyia, falando para eu ficar acordado só mais um pouco, porque ela estava vindo me visitar."

# game/episode024.rpy:134
translate portuguese episode024_6291004c:

    # "She told me she couldn’t wait to show herself wearing next to nothing."
