# game/episode024.rpy:136
translate portuguese episode024_a895df41:

    # "I was pretty certain of what she had in mind, and I wanted to surprise her in turn, so I messaged Jade and Vess to come as well."
    "Eu já tinha uma boa ideia do que ela estava pensando, aí decidi dar a minha própria surpresinha, chamando Jade e Vess também."

# game/episode024.rpy:137
translate portuguese episode024_57053c59:

    # "They were both under orders to come dressed in as little clothing as possible."
